y Control Statement</h2>\n<p>The data is provided \"as is\".</p><p>Please be aware this dataset is near real-time so the data may be partially complete.</p><p> </p>\n<h2>Assurance Statement</h2>\n<p>The Open Data team has checked the data against source to ensure data accuracy and consistency. The data domain owners have checked their respective data aspects.\n</p>\n<h2>Other</h2>\n<p>Download dataset information:\u00a0<a href=\"https://ukpowernetworks.opendatasoft.com/explore/dataset/domain-dataset0/download/?format=json&amp;refine.identifier=ukpn-live-faults\">Metadata (JSON)</a><br></p>\n<p>Definitions of key terms related to this dataset can be found in the Open Data Portal Glossary: <a href=\"https://ukpowernetworks.opendatasoft.com/pages/glossary/\" target=\"_blank\">https://ukpowernetworks.opendatasoft.com/pages/glossary/</a></p>\n<p></p>", "theme": ["Network Usage"], "keyword": null, "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "language": "en", "metadata_languages": ["en"], "timezone": null, "modified": "2026-07-27T21:03:03.397000+00:00", "modified_updates_on_metadata_change": false, "modified_updates_on_data_change": true, "data_processed": "2026-07-27T21:03:03.397000+00:00", "metadata_processed": "2026-07-27T21:03:03.459000+00:00", "geographic_reference": null, "geographic_reference_auto": false, "territory": null, "geometry_types": ["Point"], "bbox": {"type": "Feature", "geometry": {"coordinates": [[[1.394229931756854, 52.884999979287386], [-0.8638900704681873, 52.884999979287386], [-0.8638900704681873, 50.7825299911201], [1.394229931756854, 50.7825299911201], [1.394229931756854, 52.884999979287386]]], "type": "Polygon"}, "properties": {}}, "publisher": "UK Power Networks, Company number 3870728", "references": null, "records_count": 100, "attributions": null, "source_domain": null, "source_domain_title": null, "source_domain_address": null, "source_dataset": null, "shared_catalog": null, "federated": false, "par